  "name": "Observe Opponent",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/magic/perception/third-eye-blue-red.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 3rd level, as a bonus action, you can make a Wisdom (Insight) check against a creature you can see that isn't incapacitated, contested by the target's Charisma (Deception) check. If you succeed, you can use your Sneak Attack against that target even if you don't have advantage on the attack roll, but not if you have disadvantage on it. This benefit lasts for 1 minute or until you use this feature against a different target.</p>",
